---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Theysway Terms of Service"
  description="Terms for creators who connect their Instagram account to Theysway, operated by Anomalies.in."
>

  <section class="section-padding bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <div class="text-electric-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Theysway</div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-500">Last updated: 2 October 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">The service</h2>
          <p>Theysway is an influencer-marketing service operated by Anomalies.in. Creators can connect their Instagram professional account so that we can read their profile and Insights and assess fit for brand collaborations. By connecting your account, you agree to these terms.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Your account and consent</h2>
          <p>You must own, or be authorised to manage, the Instagram account you connect. Connecting is voluntary. We read only the data you approve on Instagram's consent screen, and we never post, message, follow, like, or change anything on your account.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">How your data is handled</h2>
          <p>How we collect, use, store, and delete your data is described in our <a class="text-electric-400 underline" href="/theysway/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>. We do not sell or license your data, and brands receive our analysis only.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">No guarantee of collaboration</h2>
          <p>Connecting your account does not guarantee that you will be offered, or selected for, any brand collaboration. Any collaboration is agreed separately and in writing.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Ending access</h2>
          <p>You can disconnect at any time from Instagram → Settings → Website permissions → Apps and websites. You can also ask us to delete your data, as described in the <a class="text-electric-400 underline" href="/theysway/privacy/#data-deletion">Privacy Policy</a>. We may stop offering the service, or end access for any account, at any time.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Liability</h2>
          <p>The service is provided as is. To the extent the law allows, Anomalies.in is not liable for indirect or consequential losses arising from your use of it.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Changes and governing law</h2>
          <p>We may update these terms and will change the date above when we do. These terms are governed by the laws of India.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Contact</h2>
          <p>Questions about these terms: <a class="text-electric-400 underline" href="mailto:yogesh@anomalies.in">yogesh@anomalies.in</a>.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
